\subsection{Definitions and mathematical statement}
\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
Is every isomorphism-invariant Boolean query that is decidable in deterministic polynomial time on all finite structures definable in choiceless polynomial time with counting, allowing hereditarily finite sets of arbitrary finite rank and polynomial bounds on computation stages and intermediate objects?

\subsection{Short English statement}
